{{ToonInfo|Toon=Flutter|extra=Butterfly|Date=July 12, 2024|with={{CI|Shelly|name=true}}, {{CI|Teagan|name=true}}, and {{CI|Tisha|name=true}}|Pronoun=She}}

==Appearance==
Flutter is a butterfly with a heart-shaped head and pink skin. She has two thin black antennae topped with purple hearts by the tips. She has cyan eyeshadow above her eyes and two eyelashes at the bottom of each eye. She wears a simple, light purple dress and has dark purple fur going around her neck (which is confirmed by {{CI|Tisha|name=true}} to be part of her body). Her wings are cyan with white heart outline details on the forewings and two small hindwings stylistically connected to the larger ones. She has no visible mouth or arms. Although her torso is colored a deep purple, it is unknown whether it's a shading illusion to represent the underside of her dress, her actual torso color, or a piece of clothing.

==Personality==
On her [[Introduction Card]] and her [[UGC Items]], Flutter is described as cheerful and caring, taking the "social butterfly" metaphor to a literal degree of sorts, but while interactions with some Toons adhere to the peppy traits, others reveal she actually isn't as joyous as they describe her. In fact, she easily gets frustrated over rather small things, such as still to this day being upset about the many losses she suffered on {{CI|Vee|name=true}}'s Game Show (even complaining in front of Vee herself about it), abruptly whining about her troubles in front of {{CI|Razzle & Dazzle|name=true}}, immediately either berating or being horrified by {{CI|Waxwell|name=true}} for jokingly talking about burning her wings, and getting upset over {{CI|Boxten|name=true}}'s occasional inability to understand a currently unknown part about her, whether he was referring to her preferably silent way of communication<ref>https://discord.com/channels/969934252844138496/1251545388259741768/1274866196155469836</ref> being unintelligible at times, or her emotions being difficult to read deeply and thoroughly. {{CI|Cosmo|name=true}} and {{CI|Blot|name=true}} tell her that she's more helpful than she comes across as initially, but is usually not credited for it, even when Toons like {{CI|Astro|name=true}} compliment her endurance. Despite her tendency to be frustrated or upset, she's said to be good at making others laugh, even if she didn't mean to. She is also shown to have a risk-taking side of herself in her interactions with {{CI|Connie|name=true}}, {{CI|Scraps|name=true}} and {{CI|Yatta|name=true}}, where all three of them described her potential ideas as so extreme, even they wouldn't want to do them.

Her dynamic with her older brother {{CI|Flyte|name=true}} is that of care, understanding and fun; his constant worrying for her annoys her, but he does at least agree to not go too far with it, and despite pointing out each other's differences frequently, they love and care deeply for each other.

