==Requirement Strategies==
*For the first requirement, focus on picking up [[Research Capsules]] and extracting [[Machines]]. The Machine and Capsule count increases the further you descend, so you can earn more {{II|Ichor|name=true}}.
*For the second requirement, have a Distractor [[Toon]] bring {{CI|Twisted Flutter|name=true}} to the elevator to you so you can get aggro. Playing as {{CI|Rodger|name=true}} also helps getting Research faster because of his Passive [[Ability]]. This will be easier if Twisted Flutter is on the [[Daily Twisted Board]].

==Strategies==
Flutter is a decent distractor [[Toon]] with above average [[Movement Speed]] and [[Stamina]], with her low extractability [[Stats]] and mobility based Active [[Ability]] further inducing those who want to play as her to distract. The main issue with Flutter is her average [[Stealth]], which may cause issues given that most Toons in the [[game]] either have the same or lower Stealth.

With [[Trinkets]] like {{TI|Speedy Shoes|name=true}} and {{TI|Dog Plush|name=true}}, Flutter is able to outwalk most Twisteds in the game, save for {{CI|Twisted Pebble|name=true}}, {{CI|Twisted Glisten|name=true}} (when enraged), and a few others. For that reason, looping the said Twisteds around an island or sprint-tapping may be a viable choice, with Stamina management being the main issue, which is where Flutter's Active Ability comes into place.

Flutter's Ability, {{AI|Flutter|name=true}}, is quite useful for surviving and escaping dangerous [[Twisteds]], such as {{CI|Twisted Vee|name=true}} when she applies the {{Debuff|Slow|II}} [[Debuff]] or {{CI|Twisted Pebble|name=true}} and also saving up Stamina when low at it, given the distance she gets and the amount of that's recovered during that time. Her Ability can also be used to dash away from Twisteds when [[Panic Mode]] begins, causing most of them to stay behind even with their speed buff. Do note the Ability's cooldown however, as its long enough to screw you up if you're relying on it for distance.

Since the Ability gives her  67.5 Walk Speed/77.5 Run Speed, it’ll allow her to outwalk and outrun every Twisted for less than a second, which can help her escape Twisteds like Twisted Pebble, or even max speed {{CI|Twisted Dyle|name=true}}, though it’s not always the most reliable. Cutting corners with her Ability is best if you’re specifically trying to escape, as you simultaneously build distance and break line of sight.

With her immunity to Ichor Puddles spawned by [[Ichor Leaks]], she can excel at distracting in them. Due to the fact the puddles won't slow her down or cover valuable information, she can easily loop in an area, even if it's full of Ichor Puddles.

Overall, Flutter possesses great skills for distraction, though also has slight potential for survival, even if it comes at the cost of her extraction.

